るかも、鉄道の推進者にアドバイスしうるであろう。","ref":"277969_126023","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I don't know where to go or what to do.","ja":"どこへ行くべきかも、何をすべきかも分からない。","ref":"255218_159305","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"You might have to eat those words a few years from now.","ja":"何年かしたら、その考えが間違っていたって思うかもよ。","ref":"24468_187330","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["鴨","鳧"],"glosses":["duck","easy mark","sucker","sitting duck"],"id":"1209250","lemma":"鴨","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"カモ","readings":["かも","カモ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/鴨#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/鴨/鴨/鴨.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["鴨 （人名用漢字）","鸭子","sl（赌博或其他类似竞赛中）容易得手的目标，容易上当的人 （因为鸭子经常返回某个固定地点而易被捕获）","sl鴨の味 (kamo no aji，“鸭子的味道”)的缩短形式：美味； 幸福的感觉；：婚后幸福美满的生活 （因为鸭子味道鲜美）","sl黒鴨 (kurogamo)的缩短形式：男性侍者 （因为这些人常穿着黑色制服，对比英语penguin）男管家男司机","姓氏","多个地点的名称，尤指京都的鴨川"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["鴨 （人名用漢字）"],"pos":"char"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["鸭子"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["sl（赌博或其他类似竞赛中）容易得手的目标，容易上当的人 （因为鸭子经常返回某个固定地点而易被捕获）"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["sl鴨の味 (kamo no aji，“鸭子的味道”)的缩短形式：美味； 幸福的感觉；：婚后幸福美满的生活 （因为鸭子味道鲜美）"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["sl黒鴨 (kurogamo)的缩短形式：男性侍者 （因为这些人常穿着黑色制服，对比英语penguin）男管家男司机"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["姓氏"],"pos":"name"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["多个地点的名称，尤指京都的鴨川"],"pos":"name"}]},{"accent":3,"common":false,"forms":["鴨の嘴","鴨嘴"],"glosses":["platypus (Ornithorhynchus anatinus)"],"id":"1209260","lemma":"鴨の嘴","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"カモノハシ","readings":["かものはし","カモノハシ"]},{"accent":0,"common":false,"etymology":[],"examples":[],"forms":["鴨居"],"glosses":["lintel (esp. one with grooves for sliding doors)"],"id":"1209270","lemma":"鴨居","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"カモイ","readings":["かもい"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/かもい#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/か/かも/かもい.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["拉门，拉窗等的上框。"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["拉门，拉窗等的上框。"],"pos":""}]},{"common":false,"forms":["鴨撃ち","鴨打ち","カモ撃ち","カモ打ち","かも打ち"],"glosses":["duck hunting"],"id":"1209280","lemma":"鴨撃ち","pos":["n"],"readings":["かもうち"]},{"accent":2,"common":false,"forms":["鴨猟"],"glosses":["duck hunting"],"id":"1209290","lemma":"鴨猟","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"カモリョウ","readings":["かもりょう"]},{"accent":3,"common":false,"etymology":["/it͡ɕijau/ → /it͡ɕjɔː/ → /it͡ɕoː/ 大約於室町時代借自漢語 鴨腳／鸭脚 (yājiǎo，“銀杏”)。 江户时代的民间词源认为其派生自一葉 (ichiyō，字面意思是“一片叶子”)，但据历史假名遣，一葉应读作いちえふ (ichi-efu) → いてふ (itefu)，而非いちやう (i-chau)。 漢字拼寫為熟字訓。","借自中古漢語 銀杏 (中古 ngin haengX)，使用了杏 (kyō)的慣用音 (kan'yō-on)，亦見於杏仁 (kyōnin，“銀杏種子”)。 於西元1617年可證實。"],"examples":[],"forms":["銀杏","公孫樹","鴨脚樹"],"glosses":["ginkgo (Ginkgo biloba)","gingko","maidenhair tree"],"id":"1243420","lemma":"銀杏","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"ギンナン","readings":["いちょう","こうそんじゅ","イチョウ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/銀杏#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/銀/銀杏/銀杏.html"],"synonyms":["公孫樹","鴨脚"],"zhGlosses":["银杏（Ginkgo biloba）","银杏叶形状的箭头","银杏叶形状的家紋 (kamon)","銀杏alternative kanji銀杏redirected from 公孫樹","銀杏alternative kanji"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["银杏（Ginkgo biloba）"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["银杏叶形状的箭头"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["银杏叶形状的家紋 (kamon)"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["銀杏alternative kanji銀杏redirected from 公孫樹"],"pos":"non-lemma"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["銀杏alternative kanji"],"pos":"non-lemma"}]},{"accent":1,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[],"forms":["千鳥","鵆","鴴"],"glosses":["plover"],"id":"1389070","lemma":"千鳥","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"チドリ","readings":["ちどり","チドリ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/ちどり#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/ち/ちど/ちどり.html","https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/千鳥#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/千/千鳥/千鳥.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["千鳥・鵆・鴴：鴴科。","千鳥【ちどり】 1. 千鸟，鸻。 2. 曲折，Z字形。 千