aka"}],"forms":["阿片","鴉片","亜片"],"glosses":["opium"],"id":"1586590","lemma":"阿片","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"アヘン","readings":["あへん","アヘン"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/阿片#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/阿/阿片/阿片.html","https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/あへん#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/あ/あへ/あへん.html"],"synonyms":["オピウム"],"zhGlosses":["鴉片","鸦片，阿片，大烟，阿芙蓉。","阿片alternative kanji","鴉片alt-of"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[{"ja":"阿片です 誤って大量の阿片を一度に吸って… しかし妙でござるな 阿片といえばかなり高価な薬 一般人がそんな大量に買い込める代物ではないはずだが…","source":"wty","zh":"是鴉片。他因一次誤吸大量鴉片… 這很奇怪，鴉片是很昂貴的藥，並非一般人可以大量購買的東西…"}],"glosses":["鴉片"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["鸦片，阿片，大烟，阿芙蓉。"],"pos":""},{"examples":[],"glosses":["阿片alternative kanji"],"pos":"non-lemma"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["鴉片alt-of"],"pos":"non-lemma"}]},{"accent":1,"common":false,"forms":["鴟尾","鵄尾","蚩尾"],"glosses":["ornamental ridge-end tile"],"id":"1594490","lemma":"鴟尾","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"シビ","readings":["しび"]},{"accent":0,"common":false,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"ja":"「オルニトミムス」白亜紀後半のダチョウ型恐竜。猛スピードで走りまわる。雑食性。木の実などなんでも食べる。","source":"wty","zh":"「似鳥龍」白堊紀晚期的鴕鳥型恐龍。牠們跑得非常快。牠們也是雜食動物。牠們吃水果和其他東西。"},{"en":"The pigeon and the ostrich are both birds; one can fly and the other cannot.","ja":"ハトもダチョウも共に鳥だが、前者は飛べるし、後者は飛べない。","ref":"35127_197938","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"An ostrich does not fly through the air.","ja":"ダチョウは空中を飛ばない。","ref":"40838_203600","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Ostriches are incapable of flight.","ja":"ダチョウは空を飛べない。","ref":"40839_203601","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The ostrich has wings, but it cannot fly.","ja":"ダチョウは羽があるが飛べない。","ref":"40840_203602","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["駝鳥","鴕鳥"],"glosses":["ostrich (Struthio camelus)"],"id":"1597340","lemma":"駝鳥","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"ダチョウ","readings":["だちょう","ダチョウ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/駝鳥#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/